WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.465
The whole kingdom was talking about how the royal wedding had been called off.

2
00:00:05.466 --> 00:00:10.036
Everyone was shocked and wondered what was going to happen.

3
00:00:10.037 --> 00:00:16.116
So Aladdin sent his mother to the palace.

4
00:00:16.117 --> 00:00:21.454
"That woman is back," the grand vizier said to the sultan.

5
00:00:21.455 --> 00:00:29.555
"Do you remember, my lord, how you joked that the princess would marry her son?"

6
00:00:29.556 --> 00:00:32.567
The vizier laughed.

7
00:00:32.568 --> 00:00:36.454
The sultan looked at Zeba in her plain dress.

8
00:00:36.455 --> 00:00:38.336
"I do remember."

9
00:00:38.337 --> 00:00:41.218
The sultan seemed troubled.

10
00:00:41.219 --> 00:00:42.718
"I made a promise.

11
00:00:42.719 --> 00:00:45.924
Bring the woman forward."

12
00:00:45.925 --> 00:00:50.745
Zeba bowed to the sultan as before.

13
00:00:50.746 --> 00:00:56.838
"Oh great sultan, I have come to remind you of your promise."

14
00:00:56.839 --> 00:01:04.034
The grand vizier whispered into the sultan’s ear, "My lord, see how poor she is.

15
00:01:04.035 --> 00:01:08.146
Princess Badra cannot marry her son!"

16
00:01:08.147 --> 00:01:10.963
"This problem is your fault.

17
00:01:10.964 --> 00:01:16.486
Your son is so unpleasant," the sultan whispered back angrily.

18
00:01:16.487 --> 00:01:21.999
"Nobody would want to marry him—especially my daughter!"

19
00:01:22.000 --> 00:01:25.560
The adviser spoke into the sultan’s ear again.

20
00:01:25.561 --> 00:01:29.202
"That’s impossible!" shouted the sultan.

21
00:01:29.203 --> 00:01:32.301
But after thinking a moment, he smiled.

22
00:01:32.302 --> 00:01:35.225
"Yes, it is impossible."

23
00:01:35.226 --> 00:01:38.380
The sultan then turned to Zeba.

24
00:01:38.381 --> 00:01:43.699
"Tell Aladdin that I remember my promise," he said.

25
00:01:43.700 --> 00:01:48.775
"But first, he must do something special to be worthy of the princess.

26
00:01:48.776 --> 00:01:54.700
Aladdin must send me twenty warriors carrying twenty bowls made of pure gold.

27
00:01:54.701 --> 00:01:59.019
Each bowl must be filled with sparkling jewels.

28
00:01:59.020 --> 00:02:04.366
When Aladdin has done this, Princess Badra will be his."

29
00:02:04.367 --> 00:02:11.477
The sultan smiled at the grand vizier, and Zeba frowned, bowed, and left the hall.

30
00:02:11.478 --> 00:02:16.403
Aladdin’s mother walked home, shaking her head.

31
00:02:16.404 --> 00:02:19.780
"How can my son do what the sultan asks?

32
00:02:19.781 --> 00:02:27.238
Can he return to the enchanted treasury and pick more jewels?" She sighed. "And

33
00:02:27.239 --> 00:02:31.811
where will he find twenty warriors?" "I

34
00:02:31.812 --> 00:02:36.453
told you this wouldn’t work," said Zeba when she got home. "The

35
00:02:36.454 --> 00:02:40.869
son of a tailor cannot marry a sultan’s daughter." Then

36
00:02:40.870 --> 00:02:45.457
she told Aladdin everything that had happened in the sultan’s hall. "It’s

37
00:02:45.458 --> 00:02:51.898
all the fault of that grand vizier!" she cried with a shake of her fist. Aladdin

38
00:02:51.899 --> 00:02:55.239
just laughed. "Mother,"

39
00:02:55.241 --> 00:03:00.979
he said, "the sultan thinks that he has asked for an impossible thing. But

40
00:03:00.980 --> 00:03:03.118
it’s not impossible!" "It’s

41
00:03:03.119 --> 00:03:07.200
not?" replied Zeba. "It’s

42
00:03:07.201 --> 00:03:10.393
easy!" said Aladdin. "Go

43
00:03:10.394 --> 00:03:14.603
to the bazaar and buy us something special for our evening meal. While

44
00:03:14.604 --> 00:03:18.556
you are gone, I will take care of everything." Zeba

45
00:03:18.557 --> 00:03:20.970
did as he asked. When

46
00:03:20.971 --> 00:03:26.552
she returned, she found twenty warriors crowded into her little house .

47
00:03:26.553 --> 00:03:34.624
Each one held a bowl of pure gold, and each bowl was full of jewels!

48
00:03:34.625 --> 00:03:38.406
"The genie did this!" she cried.

49
00:03:38.407 --> 00:03:42.516
"Thanks be to God for the wonderful lamp!"

50
00:03:42.517 --> 00:03:48.267
Aladdin opened the door and sent the warriors out into the street.

51
00:03:48.268 --> 00:03:53.518
"Now, Mother," said Aladdin, "I want you to go to the palace one more time.

52
00:03:53.519 --> 00:03:57.623
Deliver these warriors to the sultan."

53
00:03:57.624 --> 00:04:02.778
Zeba led the twenty warriors to the palace and into the sultan’s hall.

54
00:04:02.779 --> 00:04:07.308
They all bowed to the sultan and set their bowls before him.

55
00:04:07.309 --> 00:04:12.537
"And now what do you say, Grand Vizier?" the sultan asked.

56
00:04:12.538 --> 00:04:16.257
"Is Aladdin worthy of my daughter?"

57
00:04:16.258 --> 00:04:19.680
The sultan’s adviser was speechless.

58
00:04:19.681 --> 00:04:23.961
"Hear me, good woman!" said the sultan to Zeba.

59
00:04:23.962 --> 00:04:27.321
"Aladdin will marry Princess Badra!

60
00:04:27.322 --> 00:04:30.138
Go and tell him this news.

61
00:04:30.139 --> 00:04:32.654
And tell him to come to me at once.

62
00:04:32.655 --> 00:04:39.075
I want to meet my future son-in-law!"

